[
  {
    "slug": "pillbox",
    "lang": "zh",
    "route": "/works/pillbox",
    "alternate": "/en/works/pillbox",
    "h1": "Pillbox 舞池主视觉",
    "index": "01",
    "head": "CDJ 实时驱动的舞池主视觉：灯光跟着 BPM 和波形呼吸",
    "metaTitle": "Pillbox 舞池主视觉 — 鼠王 Ratking",
    "metaDescription": "北京 Pillbox 俱乐部 2025 舞池灯光装置：150 米点控灯带、2815 个像素点、638nm 激光，CDJ 实时驱动，预算约 7 万元，两周落地。",
    "scrollLabel": "往下看",
    "infos": [
      {
        "label": "场地",
        "value": "Pillbox，北京"
      },
      {
        "label": "类型",
        "value": "舞池主视觉 / 新媒体灯光装置"
      },
      {
        "label": "预算",
        "value": "约 7 万元"
      },
      {
        "label": "周期",
        "value": "2 周"
      },
      {
        "label": "我的角色",
        "value": "设计、编程、施工"
      }
    ],
    "sections": [
      {
        "label": "现场",
        "html": "<div class=\"js-anim-content\">\n<p>Pillbox 是北京的一间地下俱乐部。舞池上方要一组能跟着 DJ 走的主视觉，但不能停业施工；预算约 7 万元，周期 2 周。</p>\n<p>前期沟通不到 10 小时。方案、点位、配电和控制链路先在图纸上定完，再进场。现场施工 3 人 × 5 天，共 15 个工，我的角色是沟通、设计、编程、落地，全程一个人负责。</p>\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/pillbox/pillbox-01.webp\" alt=\"Pillbox 舞池上方的螺旋管道灯光装置\" fetchpriority=\"high\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1333\" decoding=\"async\" /><figcaption>Pillbox 舞池，2025.11。摄影：Akilou Photo</figcaption></figure>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "label": "设计",
        "html": "<div class=\"js-anim-content\">\n<p>舞池上方悬挂一组透明螺旋管道结构，管内穿入 150 米点控灯带和线缆；钨丝灯、激光和旋转警灯沿结构布置。</p>\n<p>装置不跑预设。CDJ 的波形和 BPM 实时进入系统，灯带和激光跟着节拍走。DJ 换歌、变速、推高潮，舞池的光会同步变化。交付后又加入 iPad 控制界面，甲方可以无线调整颜色。</p>\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/pillbox/pillbox-lineart.webp\" alt=\"Pillbox 装置线稿：螺旋管道与灯带走向\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" decoding=\"async\" /><figcaption>装置线稿：螺旋管道与灯带走向</figcaption></figure>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "label": "系统",
        "html": "<div class=\"js-anim-content\">\n<p>主控是 MadMapper。信号从 DJ 台进来：Beat Link Trigger 从 CDJ 读取实时波形与节拍，Ableton Link 同步 BPM，再分发到灯带、激光、警灯和钨丝灯。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>150 米点控灯带，2815 个像素点，经 Art-Net 控制器驱动</li>\n<li>638nm 红色激光头与旋转警灯，经 DMX512 继电器控制</li>\n<li>全彩动画激光：MadMapper Laser 模块 → Pangolin BEYOND → FB4</li>\n<li>钨丝灯：E27 T300，DMX512 Dimmer 调光</li>\n<li>iPad 经 OSC 接入 MadMapper，甲方可无线改色（交付后更新加入）</li>\n<li>辅助控制：单片机 + 传感器</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/pillbox/pillbox-signal-flow.webp\" alt=\"Pillbox 信号流：CDJ、Ableton Link、MadMapper 与灯具\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1022\" decoding=\"async\" /><figcaption>信号流：从 CDJ 到灯带、激光和钨丝灯</figcaption></figure>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "label": "主要材料",
        "html": "<div class=\"js-anim-content\">\n<p>装置用到的主要材料与规格：</p>\n<div class=\"case-materials\">\n  <figure class=\"case-material\">\n    <div class=\"case-material__media\"><img src=\"/works/pillbox/mat-led-strip.webp\" alt=\"点控灯带\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n    <figcaption class=\"case-material__caption\"><span class=\"t-md case-material__name\">点控灯带</span><span class=\"t-sm case-material__spec\">2,815 点，每米 60 灯，共 150 米</span></figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <figure class=\"case-material\">\n    <div class=\"case-material__media\"><img src=\"/works/pillbox/mat-beacon.webp\" alt=\"旋转警灯\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n    <figcaption class=\"case-material__caption\"><span class=\"t-md case-material__name\">旋转警灯</span><span class=\"t-sm case-material__spec\">DMX512 继电器控制</span></figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <figure class=\"case-material\">\n    <div class=\"case-material__media\"><img src=\"/works/pillbox/mat-rgb-laser.webp\" alt=\"全彩动画激光\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n    <figcaption class=\"case-material__caption\"><span class=\"t-md case-material__name\">全彩动画激光</span><span class=\"t-sm case-material__spec\">MadMapper Laser 模块 → Pangolin BEYOND → FB4</span></figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <figure class=\"case-material\">\n    <div class=\"case-material__media\"><img src=\"/works/pillbox/mat-laser-head.webp\" alt=\"激光头\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n    <figcaption class=\"case-material__caption\"><span class=\"t-md case-material__name\">激光头</span><span class=\"t-sm case-material__spec\">638 nm 红光，DMX512 继电器控制</span></figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <figure class=\"case-material\">\n    <div class=\"case-material__media\"><img src=\"/works/pillbox/mat-duct.webp\" alt=\"透明螺旋空调管\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n    <figcaption class=\"case-material__caption\"><span class=\"t-md case-material__name\">透明螺旋空调管</span><span class=\"t-sm case-material__spec\">装置主体结构</span></figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <figure class=\"case-material\">\n    <div class=\"case-material__media\"><img src=\"/works/pillbox/mat-tubes.webp\" alt=\"透明软管\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n    <figcaption class=\"case-material__caption\"><span class=\"t-md case-material__name\">透明软管</span><span class=\"t-sm case-material__spec\">灯带、线缆包裹</span></figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <figure class=\"case-material\">\n    <div class=\"case-material__media\"><img src=\"/works/pillbox/mat-tungsten.webp\" alt=\"钨丝灯\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n    <figcaption class=\"case-material__caption\"><span class=\"t-md case-material__name\">钨丝灯</span><span class=\"t-sm case-material__spec\">E27 T300 钨丝灯管，DMX512 Dimmer 调光</span></figcaption>\n  </figure>\n</div>\n<p class=\"case-materials__note\">另：DMX512 继电器（12V）——控制 638 nm 红色激光头与旋转警灯。</p>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "label": "施工",
        "html": "<div class=\"js-anim-content\">\n<p>布线、吊装、调试都在营业时间之外完成，白天场地照常交还。3 人 5 天，共 15 个工；灯带、激光、警灯和钨丝灯一次接通。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>预算：约 7 万元</li>\n<li>周期：2 周，从方案到落地，不影响正常营业</li>\n<li>现场：3 人 × 5 天，共 15 个工</li>\n<li>灯带：150 米，每米 60 灯，共 2815 点控</li>\n<li>激光：638nm 红色激光头 + 全彩动画激光</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"case-gallery\">\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/pillbox/pillbox-02.webp\" alt=\"Pillbox 装置现场，灯带沿螺旋管道布置\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1500\" height=\"2000\" decoding=\"async\" /></figure>\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/pillbox/pillbox-03.webp\" alt=\"Pillbox 舞池现场，灯光随 DJ 变化\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1333\" decoding=\"async\" /></figure>\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/pillbox/pillbox-04.webp\" alt=\"Pillbox 装置细节\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1500\" height=\"2000\" decoding=\"async\" /><figcaption>Pillbox 舞池，2025.11。摄影：Akilou Photo</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "label": "结果",
        "html": "<div class=\"js-anim-content\">\n<p>全自动运行：程序跟随 DJ 的 BPM，店里不需要专职灯光师，也不需要专门维护。</p>\n<p>交付后已更新 2 次，其中一次加入 iPad 控制界面；售后由我本人负责。灯亮着，才算交付。</p>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "next": {
      "href": "/contact",
      "label": "联系鼠王"
    },
    "nextTitle": "说说你的场地",
    "footerTheme": "light"
  },
  {
    "slug": "pillbox",
    "lang": "en",
    "route": "/en/works/pillbox",
    "alternate": "/works/pillbox",
    "h1": "Pillbox Dance Floor Visual",
    "index": "01",
    "head": "A dance floor visual driven live by the CDJs: light that breathes with the BPM and the waveform",
    "metaTitle": "Pillbox Dance Floor Visual — Ratking",
    "metaDescription": "Pillbox, Beijing, 2025: dance-floor lighting with 150 m of pixel-controlled LED tape, 638 nm lasers and CDJ-driven playback. Two weeks, about RMB 70,000.",
    "scrollLabel": "Scroll",
    "infos": [
      {
        "label": "Venue",
        "value": "Pillbox, Beijing"
      },
      {
        "label": "Type",
        "value": "Dance floor visual / new media lighting installation"
      },
      {
        "label": "Budget",
        "value": "Approx. RMB 70,000"
      },
      {
        "label": "Timeline",
        "value": "2 weeks"
      },
      {
        "label": "Role",
        "value": "Design, programming, build"
      }
    ],
    "sections": [
      {
        "label": "The room",
        "html": "<div class=\"js-anim-content\">\n<p>Pillbox is an underground club in Beijing. The brief was a visual above the dance floor that follows the DJ, built without closing the venue. Budget around RMB 70,000; timeline two weeks.</p>\n<p>Under ten hours of initial conversation. The scheme, fixture positions, power and the control chain were settled on paper before anyone went on site. The build was three people over five days — 15 person-days. I covered communication, design, programming and delivery — one person, end to end.</p>\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/pillbox/pillbox-01.webp\" alt=\"Spiral duct lighting installation above the Pillbox dance floor\" fetchpriority=\"high\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1333\" decoding=\"async\" /><figcaption>Pillbox dance floor, Nov 2025. Photo: Akilou Photo</figcaption></figure>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "label": "Design",
        "html": "<div class=\"js-anim-content\">\n<p>A transparent spiral duct structure hangs above the dance floor, threaded with 150 m of pixel-controlled LED tape and cable. Tungsten lamps, lasers and rotating beacons are arranged along it.</p>\n<p>The installation runs no presets. CDJ waveform and BPM feed the system in real time; the LED tape and lasers track the beat. When the DJ changes track or tempo, or pushes to a peak, the light moves with it. An iPad control interface was added after handover, so the client can change colours wirelessly.</p>\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/pillbox/pillbox-lineart.webp\" alt=\"Pillbox installation line drawing: spiral duct and LED tape routing\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" decoding=\"async\" /><figcaption>Line drawing: spiral duct and LED tape routing</figcaption></figure>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "label": "System",
        "html": "<div class=\"js-anim-content\">\n<p>MadMapper is the main controller. Signal comes in from the DJ booth: Beat Link Trigger reads live waveform and beat data from the CDJs, Ableton Link syncs BPM, and the signal is distributed to LED tape, lasers, beacons and tungsten lamps.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>150 m of pixel-controlled LED tape, 2,815 pixels, driven through an Art-Net controller</li>\n<li>638 nm red laser heads and rotating beacons, controlled through DMX512 relays</li>\n<li>Full-colour animation laser: MadMapper Laser module → Pangolin BEYOND → FB4</li>\n<li>Tungsten lamps: E27 T300, dimmed through a DMX512 dimmer</li>\n<li>iPad into MadMapper over OSC, for wireless colour control (added in a post-handover update)</li>\n<li>Auxiliary control: microcontroller + sensors</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/pillbox/pillbox-signal-flow.webp\" alt=\"Pillbox signal flow: CDJs, Ableton Link, MadMapper and fixtures\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1022\" decoding=\"async\" /><figcaption>Signal flow: from the CDJs to LED tape, lasers and tungsten lamps</figcaption></figure>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "label": "Materials",
        "html": "<div class=\"js-anim-content\">\n<p>The main materials and their specs:</p>\n<div class=\"case-materials\">\n  <figure class=\"case-material\">\n    <div class=\"case-material__media\"><img src=\"/works/pillbox/mat-led-strip.webp\" alt=\"Pixel-mapped LED tape\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n    <figcaption class=\"case-material__caption\"><span class=\"t-md case-material__name\">Pixel-mapped LED tape</span><span class=\"t-sm case-material__spec\">2,815 pixels, 60 LEDs per metre, 150 m in total</span></figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <figure class=\"case-material\">\n    <div class=\"case-material__media\"><img src=\"/works/pillbox/mat-beacon.webp\" alt=\"Rotating beacon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n    <figcaption class=\"case-material__caption\"><span class=\"t-md case-material__name\">Rotating beacon</span><span class=\"t-sm case-material__spec\">switched by a DMX512 relay</span></figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <figure class=\"case-material\">\n    <div class=\"case-material__media\"><img src=\"/works/pillbox/mat-rgb-laser.webp\" alt=\"Full-colour animation laser\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n    <figcaption class=\"case-material__caption\"><span class=\"t-md case-material__name\">Full-colour animation laser</span><span class=\"t-sm case-material__spec\">MadMapper Laser module → Pangolin BEYOND → FB4</span></figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <figure class=\"case-material\">\n    <div class=\"case-material__media\"><img src=\"/works/pillbox/mat-laser-head.webp\" alt=\"Laser head\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n    <figcaption class=\"case-material__caption\"><span class=\"t-md case-material__name\">Laser head</span><span class=\"t-sm case-material__spec\">638 nm red, switched by a DMX512 relay</span></figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <figure class=\"case-material\">\n    <div class=\"case-material__media\"><img src=\"/works/pillbox/mat-duct.webp\" alt=\"Clear spiral duct\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n    <figcaption class=\"case-material__caption\"><span class=\"t-md case-material__name\">Clear spiral duct</span><span class=\"t-sm case-material__spec\">the main structure of the installation</span></figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <figure class=\"case-material\">\n    <div class=\"case-material__media\"><img src=\"/works/pillbox/mat-tubes.webp\" alt=\"Clear flexible tube\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n    <figcaption class=\"case-material__caption\"><span class=\"t-md case-material__name\">Clear flexible tube</span><span class=\"t-sm case-material__spec\">wraps the LED tape and cabling</span></figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <figure class=\"case-material\">\n    <div class=\"case-material__media\"><img src=\"/works/pillbox/mat-tungsten.webp\" alt=\"Tungsten lamp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n    <figcaption class=\"case-material__caption\"><span class=\"t-md case-material__name\">Tungsten lamp</span><span class=\"t-sm case-material__spec\">E27 T300 tungsten tube, dimmed by a DMX512 dimmer</span></figcaption>\n  </figure>\n</div>\n<p class=\"case-materials__note\">Also: a DMX512 relay (12V) controls the 638 nm red laser head and the rotating beacon.</p>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "label": "Build",
        "html": "<div class=\"js-anim-content\">\n<p>Cabling, rigging and commissioning all happened outside opening hours; the room was handed back for daytime use. Three people, five days, 15 person-days. LED tape, lasers, beacons and tungsten lamps were all brought online in one pass.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Budget: approx. RMB 70,000</li>\n<li>Timeline: two weeks from design to handover, with no disruption to normal business</li>\n<li>On site: 3 people × 5 days, 15 person-days</li>\n<li>LED tape: 150 m, 60 pixels per metre, 2,815 pixels in total</li>\n<li>Lasers: 638 nm red laser heads + full-colour animation laser</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"case-gallery\">\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/pillbox/pillbox-02.webp\" alt=\"Pillbox installation on site, LED tape along the spiral duct\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1500\" height=\"2000\" decoding=\"async\" /></figure>\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/pillbox/pillbox-03.webp\" alt=\"Pillbox dance floor with light following the DJ\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1333\" decoding=\"async\" /></figure>\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/pillbox/pillbox-04.webp\" alt=\"Pillbox installation detail\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1500\" height=\"2000\" decoding=\"async\" /><figcaption>Pillbox dance floor, Nov 2025. Photo: Akilou Photo</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "label": "Result",
        "html": "<div class=\"js-anim-content\">\n<p>It runs fully automatically: the program follows the DJ's BPM, so the venue needs no dedicated lighting operator and no routine maintenance.</p>\n<p>Two updates since handover, one of which added the iPad control interface. I handle after-sales myself. It only counts as delivered while the lights are on.</p>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "next": {
      "href": "/en/contact",
      "label": "Contact Ratking"
    },
    "nextTitle": "Tell me about your venue",
    "footerTheme": "light"
  },
  {
    "slug": "wigwam-park-2025",
    "lang": "zh",
    "route": "/works/wigwam-park-2025",
    "alternate": "/en/works/wigwam-park-2025",
    "h1": "上海 · WIGWAM PARK 2025",
    "index": "04",
    "head": "钨丝灯、频闪与烟雾，让光成为音乐之外的表达",
    "metaTitle": "WIGWAM PARK 2025 灯光 — 鼠王 Ratking",
    "metaDescription": "上海 WIGWAM PARK 2025 音乐节：金字塔帐篷舞台的灯光控制与现场落地，钨丝、频闪与烟机配合 SDS TEAM 舞美设计。",
    "scrollLabel": "往下看",
    "infos": [
      {
        "label": "场地",
        "value": "上海，WIGWAM PARK"
      },
      {
        "label": "类型",
        "value": "户外音乐节 / 舞台灯光"
      },
      {
        "label": "年份",
        "value": "2025"
      },
      {
        "label": "我的角色",
        "value": "灯光控制、现场落地"
      },
      {
        "label": "团队",
        "value": "舞美设计 SDS TEAM；灯具租赁 上海驰郎文化传播有限公司"
      }
    ],
    "sections": [
      {
        "label": "现场",
        "html": "<div class=\"js-anim-content\">\n<p>WIGWAM PARK 2025 在上海的一处园区。舞台是几座金字塔式帐篷，顶端一盏球形灯，人群围在帐篷前。</p>\n<p>入夜后，钨丝灯的暖光、频闪和烟雾把舞台包住。灯不只是照亮，它和音乐一起，构成现场的另一层表达。</p>\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/wigwam-park-2025/wigwam-02.webp\" alt=\"WIGWAM PARK 2025 园区夜景：金字塔帐篷舞台、人群与烟雾\" fetchpriority=\"high\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1334\" decoding=\"async\" /><figcaption>WIGWAM PARK 2025 现场，上海</figcaption></figure>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "label": "设计",
        "html": "<div class=\"js-anim-content\">\n<p>光的出发点是让声音与空间发生联系。金字塔帐篷定下舞台的轮廓，顶部球形灯收住视线；钨丝暖光铺底，频闪和烟雾把节奏推出来。</p>\n<p>灯位按舞台结构排布，桁架、PAR 灯和控台的位置落在灯位图上，再进现场落地。</p>\n<p>Mohemann 说：“隧道尽头会有光。”在 WIGWAM，光从帐篷顶端落下来。</p>\n<div class=\"case-gallery\">\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/wigwam-park-2025/wigwam-stage.webp\" alt=\"WIGWAM PARK 2025 灯位与舞台示意：桁架、PAR 灯与控台\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1276\" height=\"624\" decoding=\"async\" /><figcaption>灯位与舞台示意</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/wigwam-park-2025/wigwam-05.webp\" alt=\"红色与青色烟雾中的帐篷尖顶\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1334\" height=\"2000\" decoding=\"async\" /></figure>\n</div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "label": "灯光配置",
        "html": "<div class=\"js-anim-content\">\n<p>现场灯具与烟雾：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>12 台大歌 380</li>\n<li>4 台 LED 频闪</li>\n<li>20 个钨丝 PAR 灯</li>\n<li>16 盏 PAR64</li>\n<li>2 台十眼钨丝灯</li>\n<li>2 台大功率直喷烟机</li>\n</ul>\n<p>舞美设计由 SDS TEAM 完成，灯具租赁来自上海驰郎文化传播有限公司。我负责灯光控制与现场落地。</p>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "label": "现场记录",
        "html": "<div class=\"js-anim-content\">\n<p>从帐篷外到帐篷内，光把人群、DJ 和舞台连在一起。</p>\n<div class=\"case-gallery\">\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/wigwam-park-2025/wigwam-01.webp\" alt=\"金字塔帐篷舞台，顶端球形灯与钨丝暖光\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1332\" height=\"2000\" decoding=\"async\" /></figure>\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/wigwam-park-2025/wigwam-04.webp\" alt=\"DJ 在 CDJ 前，暖色与绿色灯光穿过烟雾\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1334\" decoding=\"async\" /></figure>\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/wigwam-park-2025/wigwam-06.webp\" alt=\"仰视布幔天花与橙色烟雾，可见 PARK 字样\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1334\" decoding=\"async\" /></figure>\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/wigwam-park-2025/wigwam-07.webp\" alt=\"帐篷内的 DJ 与金字塔舞台、顶部球形灯\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1334\" height=\"2000\" decoding=\"async\" /><figcaption>WIGWAM PARK 2025 现场，上海</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n</div>"
