    "h1": "Shanghai · WIGWAM PARK 2025",
    "index": "04",
    "head": "Tungsten, strobe and smoke — light as another voice beside the music",
    "metaTitle": "WIGWAM PARK 2025 Lighting — Ratking",
    "metaDescription": "Festival lighting for WIGWAM PARK 2025, Shanghai: tungsten, strobe and smoke across pyramid tents. 12 Dage 380s, 4 LED strobes; control/build with SDS TEAM.",
    "scrollLabel": "Scroll",
    "infos": [
      {
        "label": "Venue",
        "value": "WIGWAM PARK, Shanghai"
      },
      {
        "label": "Type",
        "value": "Outdoor festival / stage lighting"
      },
      {
        "label": "Year",
        "value": "2025"
      },
      {
        "label": "Role",
        "value": "Lighting control, on-site delivery"
      },
      {
        "label": "Team",
        "value": "Stage design SDS TEAM; fixture rental Shanghai Chilang Culture Communication Co., Ltd."
      }
    ],
    "sections": [
      {
        "label": "The site",
        "html": "<div class=\"js-anim-content\">\n<p>WIGWAM PARK 2025 took place in a park in Shanghai. The stage was a cluster of pyramid tents, a spherical lamp at the apex, with the crowd gathered in front.</p>\n<p>After dark, tungsten warmth, strobe and smoke wrapped the stage. The light did more than illuminate — with the music, it became another layer of the event.</p>\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/wigwam-park-2025/wigwam-02.webp\" alt=\"WIGWAM PARK 2025 at night: pyramid stage, crowd and smoke\" fetchpriority=\"high\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1334\" decoding=\"async\" /><figcaption>WIGWAM PARK 2025, Shanghai</figcaption></figure>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "label": "Design",
        "html": "<div class=\"js-anim-content\">\n<p>The starting point was to connect the sound to the space. The pyramid tents set the stage silhouette and the spherical lamp at the apex held the eye; tungsten warmth carried the base while strobe and smoke pushed the rhythm forward.</p>\n<p>Fixtures were laid out around the stage structure. Truss, PAR lamps and the control position were set on the lighting plot, then built on site.</p>\n<p>Mohemann put it this way: “there will be light at the end of the tunnel.” At WIGWAM, it came down from the top of the tent.</p>\n<div class=\"case-gallery\">\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/wigwam-park-2025/wigwam-stage.webp\" alt=\"WIGWAM PARK 2025 lighting plot: truss, PAR lamps and control position\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1276\" height=\"624\" decoding=\"async\" /><figcaption>Lighting plot and stage layout</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/wigwam-park-2025/wigwam-05.webp\" alt=\"Tent apex in red and cyan smoke\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1334\" height=\"2000\" decoding=\"async\" /></figure>\n</div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "label": "Lighting rig",
        "html": "<div class=\"js-anim-content\">\n<p>Fixtures and haze on site:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>12 × Dage 380</li>\n<li>4 × LED strobe</li>\n<li>20 × tungsten PAR lamp</li>\n<li>16 × PAR64</li>\n<li>2 × ten-eye tungsten fixture</li>\n<li>2 × high-output direct-fog machine</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Stage design by SDS TEAM; fixture rental from Shanghai Chilang Culture Communication Co., Ltd. I handled lighting control and on-site delivery.</p>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "label": "On site",
        "html": "<div class=\"js-anim-content\">\n<p>From outside the tents to inside, the light connected the crowd, the DJ and the stage.</p>\n<div class=\"case-gallery\">\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/wigwam-park-2025/wigwam-01.webp\" alt=\"Pyramid tent stage with spherical lamp and tungsten warmth\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1332\" height=\"2000\" decoding=\"async\" /></figure>\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/wigwam-park-2025/wigwam-04.webp\" alt=\"DJ at the CDJs, warm and green light through smoke\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1334\" decoding=\"async\" /></figure>\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/wigwam-park-2025/wigwam-06.webp\" alt=\"Looking up at draped ceiling and orange smoke, PARK sign visible\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1334\" decoding=\"async\" /></figure>\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/wigwam-park-2025/wigwam-07.webp\" alt=\"DJ inside the pyramid tent beneath the spherical lamp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1334\" height=\"2000\" decoding=\"async\" /><figcaption>WIGWAM PARK 2025, Shanghai</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
