    "sections": [
      {
        "label": "The site",
        "html": "<div class=\"js-anim-content\">\n<p>YOUSHAN takes place at night in Beijing. The stage is a dome tent, the crowd gathered around it, with light entering the space from the sides and from within.</p>\n<p>Colour side light, warm interior light, smoke and beams worked together. The light stayed close to the music, then close to the people in the room.</p>\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/youshan-2025/youshan-01.webp\" alt=\"YOUSHAN 2025 dome stage: pink and blue side light, smoke and crowd silhouettes\" fetchpriority=\"high\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1333\" decoding=\"async\" /><figcaption>YOUSHAN Festival 2025, Beijing</figcaption></figure>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "label": "Design",
        "html": "<div class=\"js-anim-content\">\n<p>The design started from the music and the mood of the room. The dome gives the space its enclosure; pink, blue and violet side light draws the tent outline; warm light stays in the interior so the crowd can still see each other.</p>\n<p>Smoke gives the beams a shape. The light follows the music, and its rises and falls stay close to the mood of the room.</p>\n<div class=\"case-gallery\">\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/youshan-2025/youshan-02.webp\" alt=\"Front of the dome: pink and blue rim light with the DJ in warm interior light\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1333\" decoding=\"async\" /></figure>\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/youshan-2025/youshan-04.webp\" alt=\"Tent silhouette in thick yellow smoke\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1337\" height=\"2000\" decoding=\"async\" /></figure>\n</div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "label": "Control and team",
        "html": "<div class=\"js-anim-content\">\n<p>Credits and roles:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Lighting mood design: Lyu Zhi-Qiang (Mohemann)</li>\n<li>On-site execution and lighting control programming: DancRan (SDS TEAM)</li>\n<li>Lighting control: Ratking</li>\n</ul>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "label": "On site",
        "html": "<div class=\"js-anim-content\">\n<p>A few angles from the site, from the side of the tent to the crowd.</p>\n<div class=\"case-gallery\">\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/youshan-2025/youshan-03.webp\" alt=\"Side of a pyramid tent in deep blue ambient light, red glow inside\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1333\" decoding=\"async\" /></figure>\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/youshan-2025/youshan-05.webp\" alt=\"Pyramid tent in orange wash with green and white beams over the crowd\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1333\" decoding=\"async\" /></figure>\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/youshan-2025/youshan-06.webp\" alt=\"Crowd silhouettes against orange backlight\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1706\" height=\"1706\" decoding=\"async\" /></figure>\n<figure class=\"case-figure\"><img src=\"/works/youshan-2025/youshan-07.webp\" alt=\"Crowd silhouettes in red and orange backlight\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1333\" decoding=\"async\" /><figcaption>YOUSHAN Festival 2025, Beijing</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n</div>"
      }
